<template>
  <section>
    <h2 class="pdx-txt-heading">Scope and Limitations</h2>
    <p class="pdx-txt-small pdx-ink-muted">
      <code>@@try/@@catch</code> and <code>&lt;pdx-error-boundary&gt;</code> catch:
    </p>
    <ul class="pdx-txt-small" style="margin: 0.5rem 0; padding-left: 1.5rem">
      <li><strong>Render errors</strong> — throw in contentFn()</li>
      <li><strong>Effect errors</strong> — throw in tracked effects</li>
      <li><strong>Event handler errors</strong> — @@click, @@input, etc. (compiler wraps with safeHandler, routes to nearest boundary)</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="pdx-txt-small pdx-ink-muted">
      <code>onGlobalError()</code> is the last-resort fallback and additionally catches:
    </p>
    <ul class="pdx-txt-small" style="margin: 0.5rem 0; padding-left: 1.5rem">
      <li><strong>Unhandled event errors</strong> — when no local boundary is active</li>
      <li><strong>Async rejections</strong> — unhandled Promise rejections</li>
      <li><strong>Uncaught exceptions</strong> — window.onerror fallback</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</template>
